# Game Content Source Policy

For this project, all game content JSON must come from remote sources only:

- Primary sources: DB-backed config/data and GitHub Pages content.
- Never implement or keep behavior that reads game content JSON from bundled app assets as the source of truth.

Required behavior:

- When adding or updating game content loading logic, use DB/GitHub Pages paths.
- If a fallback source is needed, ask the user first before adding any local asset fallback.
- If there is uncertainty about which source to use, ask the user before making changes.

Disallowed by default:

- Loading game content JSON from `app/src/main/assets/...` for runtime content updates.
- Silent local fallback that can override or mask remote content issues.
